# Onboard a new office

This configuration onboards a new office in one `terraform apply`:

1. every employee becomes a member with role `read` and gets the invitation mail in their language;
2. the office server gets a one-time setup code and a `#cloud-config` document;
3. every employee may use the office's Beam-in devices (the NAS, ...) and their network;
4. the IT partner gets a 30-day Beam-in code for remote login and HTTPS on the NAS only.

It needs an API key with the sections **Users** and **Connections** (Read and Write) and the **Management** package.
`terraform apply` a second time shows no changes; `terraform destroy` offboards the members, revokes the grants, the code
and the unused setup code.

