## A server created in the same configuration

When the same configuration creates the server from `cloud_init`, do **not** set `wait_for_device` on the
`awacino_beamin_device` - the server is only created after that resource is done, so it would wait for itself. Wait with the
`awacino_device` data source instead:

```terraform
resource "hcloud_server" "office" {
  name        = "hamburg-server-01"
  server_type = "cx22"
  image       = "debian-12"
  user_data   = awacino_beamin_device.office_server.cloud_init
}

data "awacino_device" "office_server" {
  external_id  = awacino_beamin_device.office_server.external_id
  wait_timeout = "20m"
  depends_on   = [hcloud_server.office]
}
```

`data.awacino_device.office_server.id` is then the registered Beam-in device for grants and Beam-in codes.
